# Detection: Failed Logon Threshold (Brute Force / Password Guessing - T1110.001)
#
# Fires when a single host accumulates 3 or more failed logon events
# (Windows Event ID 4625) within the search window.
#
# Data source: Local Event Log Collection Monitor input on the Windows
# Security event log.
#
# Alert configuration (Save As Alert):
#   Alert type:        Real-time
#   Trigger Condition: Number of Results is greater than 0, in 1 minute
#     (NOTE: the >=3 failure threshold is already encoded in the search
#      below via `where count >= 3` -- the trigger condition only needs
#      to fire on ANY result being returned, not on a count > 2/3.)
#   Trigger:           For each result
#   Throttle:          Enabled
#     Suppress results containing field value: ComputerName
#     Suppress triggering for:                 60 seconds
#   Trigger Action:    Add to Triggered Alerts
#   Severity:          Low

index=* EventCode=4625
| stats count by ComputerName, host
| where count >= 3
